OL,3,GNEWSAGoole is all I hoped it would be,
OL,4,Asays club backer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US businessman who has made a major
OL,7,Finvestment in Goole AFC says the town
OL,8,Fis "exactly what he thought and hoped
OL,9,Fit would be".
OL,11,FMichael Becker, a digital health
OL,12,Fentrepreneur from Wisconsin, has bought
OL,13,Fa stake in the club, who currently play
OL,14,Fin Division One of the Northern
OL,15,FCounties East League ` the 10th tier of
OL,16,FEnglish football.
OL,18,FHe has made the 3,800-mile (6,100km)
OL,19,Ftrip to watch the team play for the
OL,20,Ffirst time, after following them from
OL,21,Fafar for the past 18 months.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
